{"sections":[{"slug":"En-算畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"En-算畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"En-<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"En-算畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$E_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">算畴的一种构造是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/小n-方块算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">小</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">方块算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">元运算是</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">个方块</span> $\\sqcup_k [0,1]^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">到一个方块的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">横平竖直</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的嵌入</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\mathbb E_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">密切相关的一个算畴是</span> $\\mathsf{BTop}(n)$, <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/BTop_n","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑圆盘的分类空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}